IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ha88-types`
IMPORT `ha88-possession`
IMPORT `ha88-damages`

-- Housing Act 1988 (UK) — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Possession case` HAS
    `a section 8 notice`                                IS A MAYBE `Section 8 notice`
    `a section 21 notice`                               IS A MAYBE `Section 21 notice`
    `an eviction`                                       IS A MAYBE `Eviction facts`

DECLARE `Possession position` HAS
    `earliest date for s 8 proceedings`                 IS A MAYBE DATE
    `latest date for s 8 proceedings`                   IS A MAYBE DATE
    `Ground 7A notice in time`                          IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `s 21 notice valid as to timing`                    IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `last day for s 21 proceedings`                     IS A MAYBE DATE
    `landlord liable for unlawful eviction`             IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
    `statutory damages`                                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER

@ref ss 8, 21, 27, 28
@export default The position under the Housing Act 1988 (UK) for possession of an assured tenancy: for a s 8 notice, the earliest and latest dates for proceedings (pre-Renters' Rights Act 2025 version; NOTHING for the amended version, whose table is not in the source) and whether a Ground 7A notice was served in time; for a s 21 notice (England), whether it is valid as to timing and the last day for proceedings; and for an unlawful eviction, liability and the statutory damages under ss 27-28. DRAFT, not reviewed by a UK lawyer.
GIVEN c IS A `Possession case`  @desc Any s 8 notice, any s 21 notice, and any eviction
GIVETH A `Possession position`
`the possession position for` c MEANS
    `Possession position` WITH
        `earliest date for s 8 proceedings`             IS
            CONSIDER c's `a section 8 notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN
                CONSIDER n's `version`
                WHEN `before the Renters' Rights Act 2025` THEN JUST (`the earliest date for proceedings under` n)
                OTHERWISE NOTHING
        `latest date for s 8 proceedings`               IS
            CONSIDER c's `a section 8 notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`the latest date for proceedings under` n)
        `Ground 7A notice in time`                      IS
            CONSIDER c's `a section 8 notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`a Ground 7A notice was served in time under` n)
        `s 21 notice valid as to timing`                IS
            CONSIDER c's `a section 21 notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`the s 21 notice is valid as to timing` n)
        `last day for s 21 proceedings`                 IS
            CONSIDER c's `a section 21 notice`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST n  THEN JUST (`the last day for s 21 proceedings under` n)
        `landlord liable for unlawful eviction`         IS
            CONSIDER c's `an eviction`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST e  THEN JUST (`the landlord is liable under s 27 for` e)
        `statutory damages`                             IS
            CONSIDER c's `an eviction`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST e  THEN JUST (`the statutory damages for` e)
